E_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":3246434986,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、パイモン、ありがとう。君たちの助けがなければ、僕はこの任務を果たせなかっただろう。","nextNodeIds":[755070102]},{"nodeId":755070102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1955778666,"text":"今なら「組織」に招待してくれる？","nextNodeIds":[755070103]},{"nodeId":755070103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1050086618,"text":"本当に入るつもりだったのかよ！","nextNodeIds":[755070104]},{"nodeId":755070104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":3485502106,"text":"うーん…年齢的にちょっと微妙かな。ほかのメンバーの意見も聞かないといけないしね。みんなで投票してゴーサインが出たら、前例がないわけでもないかな。","nextNodeIds":[755070105]},{"nodeId":755070105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":1835096378,"text":"もし後でナド・クライに行けたら、ナシャタウンの「スペランザ」に行ってみて。カーリャは僕たちのメンバーじゃないけど、信頼できる人だよ。きっと力になってくれる。","nextNodeIds":[755070106]},{"nodeId":755070106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":531864210,"text":"#おっ、おう。そういえばお前、{NICKNAME}が戦ってる間も、写真を撮ったり、ノートに何か描いたりして…なんかプロっぽかったよな！","nextNodeIds":[755070107,755070108]},{"nodeId":755070107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1971652578,"text":"まさか戦い方をパクろうとしてたとか…","nextNodeIds":[755070109]},{"nodeId":755070109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":4181456754,"text":"そうだな…君たちになら教えてもいいか。僕の役目は百種類の怪物の情報を集める事なんだ。君たちのおかげで、ナタとフォンテーヌについては達成できた。","nextNodeIds":[755070110]},{"nodeId":755070110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":879356514,"text":"この後はスメールだね。エルマイト旅団にお願いしてみようかな。あ、でもその前に、完成した図鑑をナシャタウンに送り返さないと…","nextNodeIds":[755070111]},{"nodeId":755070111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1877991674,"text":"へぇ、怪物図鑑を作ってたのか？","nextNodeIds":[755070112]},{"nodeId":755070112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":3053806202,"text":"うん。ナド・クライにはもう僕の知らない怪物はいないからね。ほかの場所に行ってみたいよ。","nextNodeIds":[755070113]},{"nodeId":755070113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":531403010,"text":"メイジーは臆病なのに、こういう怪物の話が大好きなんだ。昔から完成したてほやほやの図鑑を渡すたびに、目をキラキラさせて喜んでくれてさ。","nextNodeIds":[755070114]},{"nodeId":755070114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":142705730,"text":"一緒に連れてきたいけど、あの子は体が弱くて、遠くへは行けない。それにカーリャは、図鑑が上手く出来れば、出版もできるかもしれないって言ってた。","nextNodeIds":[755070115]},{"nodeId":755070115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":3190996498,"text":"出版された図鑑を持ち帰って、サプライズにこっそりあの子の枕の下に隠したりしたら…コホン、話が逸れちゃったね。","nextNodeIds":[755070116]},{"nodeId":755070116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":64029546,"text":"へへっ、ヘルカは本当に友達思いなんだな。","nextNodeIds":[755070117]},{"nodeId":755070117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":3214223426,"text":"友達というより、家族…かな。血は繋がってないけどね。アハハ、もう、この話はよそうよ。","nextNodeIds":[755070118]},{"nodeId":755070118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":2850394754,"text":"そうだ、今回の図鑑だけど、君たちにもコピーをあげるよ。写真のバックアップも必要だし、メイジーに送らなきゃならないから、君たちの分は…","nextNodeIds":[755070119,755070120]},{"nodeId":755070119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":123877882,"text":"写真には心得があるから。","nextNodeIds":[755070121]},{"nodeId":755070121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":818279890,"text":"それならよかった。僕もそろそろ次の目的地に向かおうかな。数日後にはここを発つよ。","nextNodeIds":[755070122]},{"nodeId":755070122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3942573882,"text":"おう！気をつけろよ。","nextNodeIds":[755070123]},{"nodeId":755070123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","textMapHash":2712988666,"text":"ありがとう。君たちもね！良い旅を！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":755070120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3898052922,"text":"「怪物」にはいつでも会えるから。","nextNodeIds":[755070121]},{"nodeId":755070108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4208711834,"text":"まさか画家で映影監督だったり…","nextNodeIds":[755070109]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7550701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30718"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7550701],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30718,"speakerName":"ヘルカ","count":13},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":5},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":5}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[175507],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":57032710,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_ACTIVITY","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/EffigyChallengeV6_75507/Q7550701","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":fa